:xfrm rot="0"><a:off x="5857637" y="1478899"/><a:ext cx="3393948" cy="3818930"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t" rtlCol="false" tIns="0" lIns="0" bIns="0" rIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1824"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" b="true" sz="1520" spc="-19"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="FFFFFF"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Open Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Open Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Open Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Open Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Remarks</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1824"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1119" spc="2"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:ea typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:cs typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:sym typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/></a:rPr><a:t>Used ML combined with weather-based dispersion analysis to predict disease spread early — good for prevention, but doesn't classify severity or give explainability.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1119" spc="2"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:ea typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:cs typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:sym typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/></a:rPr><a:t>Built a hybrid CNN model for banana disease classification with high accuracy — strong on detection, but a "black box" (no explainability), and no severity grading.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1119" spc="2"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:ea typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:cs typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:sym typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/></a:rPr><a:t>Combined CNN (feature extraction) + SVM (classification) to improve accuracy over plain CNN — shows hybrid models outperform others.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1119" spc="2"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:ea typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:cs typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:sym typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/></a:rPr><a:t>Also used CNN-SVM specifically for banana disease identification, reinforcing this as a mature, reliable approach for the classification step.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1343"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1119" spc="2"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:ea typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:cs typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/><a:sym typeface="IBM Plex Sans Condensed"/></a:rPr><a:t>Used YOLOv10 for detection and localization — meaning it can point out where on the leaf the disease is, not just classify it.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr name="TextBox 15" id="15"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="true"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm rot="0"><a:off x="584197" y="4992424"/><a:ext cx="451123" cy="186442"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t" rtlCol="false" tIns="0" lIns="0" bIns="0" rIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1567"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr 